<title>AUSTRALIA: RUGBY UNION-AUSTRALIA BEAT SCOTTISH DISTRICTS 25-9.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-AUSTRALIA BEAT SCOTTISH DISTRICTS 25-9.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Scotland 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat Scottish Districts 25-9 (halftime 8-6) in a rugby union tour match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Scottish Districts - Penalties: Gary Parker (3)</p>
<p>Australia - Tries: Adam Magro, Joe Roff, Dirk Williams. Conversions: Tim  Wallace (2). Penalties: Wallace (2).</p>
